  "name": "Nuberea",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "NuBerea is an AI-powered Bible study assistant that helps users explore Scripture with scholarly depth through integrated Greek and Hebrew lexicons, morphologically tagged biblical texts, cross-references, and theological concepts for interpreting the Bible responsibly.",
